  "question": {
    "text": "In the spectrum of the hydrogen atom, the ratio of the wavelengths of the longest wavelength in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></math> series to the longest wavelength in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></math> series is",
    "image": null
  },
